{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:58:28+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-22T15:58:28+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Banco de Sabadell, S.A.","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Banks - Diversified","country":"Spain","city":"Sabadell","website":"https://www.grupbancsabadell.com","employees":13842,"summary":"Banco de Sabadell, S.A. provides banking products and services in Spain, the United Kingdom, and Mexico. The company offers retail banking products, including investment products and medium- and long-term finance, such as consumer loans, mortgages, leasing and rental services, as well as other short-term finance; and cards and insurance products to individuals for personal use. It also provides financial products and services comprising investment and financing products, which include working capital products, revolving loans, and medium- and long-term finance; and custom structured finance and capital market solutions, and specialized advice for businesses; and cards and PoS terminals, as well as import and export and personalized expert advice services to companies and self-employed persons. In addition, the company offers corporate banking services consisting of financial and advisory solutions to large corporations and financial institutions; and structured finance, treasury, investment banking, trading, and custody and research services. Further, it provides current and savings accounts, loans, credit cards, and mortgages; and banking and financial services for corporate and commercial banking. Banco de Sabadell, S.A. was founded in 1881 and is based in Sabadell, Spain.","exchange":"MCE","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Banco de Sabadell, S.A. fournit des produits et services bancaires en Espagne, au Royaume-Uni et au Mexique. La société offre des produits de banque de détail, y compris des produits d'investissement et des financements à moyen et long terme, tels que des prêts à la consommation, des prêts hypothécaires, des services de location et de location, ainsi que d'autres financements à court terme; et des cartes et des produits d'assurance à des particuliers pour un usage personnel. Il fournit également des produits et services financiers comprenant des produits d'investissement et de financement, qui comprennent des produits de fonds de roulement, des prêts renouvelables et des financements à moyen et long terme; des solutions de financement structuré et de marché des capitaux sur mesure, des conseils spécialisés pour les entreprises; et des cartes et terminaux PoS, ainsi que des services d'importation et d'exportation et des conseils d'experts personnalisés aux entreprises et aux travailleurs indépendants."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":16054258688,"shares_outstanding":4701100743,"trailing_pe":14.229167,"forward_pe":10.336269,"price_to_book":1.2148701,"ev_to_ebitda":null,"ev_to_revenue":8.769,"dividend_yield":0.057600003,"payout_ratio":0.8733,"beta_yahoo":0.556},"targets":{"current_price":3.415,"mean":3.61975,"median":3.6875,"high":4.5,"low":2.3,"n_analysts":20,"reco_mean":2.7,"reco_key":"hold"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-10-29"],"eps_avg":0.07303,"eps_low":0.07007,"eps_high":0.07599,"revenue_avg":1282126000,"ex_dividend":"2026-05-27","dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.09228,"institutions_pct":0.42507,"institutions_float_pct":0.46828,"institutions_n":342,"institutions":[{"name":"Pacer Advisors, Inc.","pct":0.0,"shares":21667,"value":73992,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":-0.0602}],"funds":[{"name":"VANGUARD STAR FUNDS-Vanguard Total International Stock Index Fund","pct":0.0145000005,"shares":69201363,"value":236322652,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":-0.0525},{"name":"JANUS INVESTMENT FUND-Janus Henderson Global Equity Income Fund","pct":0.0097,"shares":46465269,"value":158678891,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":-0.0052},{"name":"VANGUARD TAX-MANAGED FUNDS-Vanguar